WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:06.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il suffit de les apercevoir

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:07.408 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelques instants pour

00:00:05.639 --> 00:00:08.475 size:53% position:73% line:53%
