00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:11.679 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lynx, deux femelles et un mâle,

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.713 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui explorent leur tout nouvel

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.781 size:53% position:73% line:53%
