00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:18.285 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des be lynx,

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:21.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vraiment très beaux à voir,

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:22.823 size:53% position:73% line:53%
