00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:51.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lation en milieu

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:58.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
naturel si on avait besoin

00:01:50.778 --> 00:01:59.253 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de réintroduire des idividus

00:01:52.045 --> 00:02:00.654 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en nature.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:01.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et, pour ceux qui se demandent

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:03.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
peut-être quel sont les noms

00:02:00.988 --> 00:02:04.458 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des trois petites vedettes

00:02:02.256 --> 00:02:05.726 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Biodôme, la réponse est

00:02:04.391 --> 00:02:06.994 size:53% position:73% line:53%
simple.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ici, on veut vraiment

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:09.563 size:53% position:73% line:53%
